{
  "_readme": "Template for LangNotebook/wwwroot/config/app.config.json, the one configuration file (git-ignored; copy this file there). Everything in it is optional: a section you leave out, or a missing file, uses the built-in default from Service/AppConfig.cs, and the cloud buttons show \"Not set up\" until client IDs are filled in. See docs/configuration.md.",
